{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a hard game.</strong><br><br>With nothing but your pogo stick to rely on, your goal is simple: reach the top - where the beyond awaits.<br><br>The controls are simple: mouse to tilt, space to jump. Controllers supported.<br><br>Don't be fooled by the simplicity. Between trampolines, swings, and massive leaps, every bounce is a test of precision and patience.<br><br>You'll fall. A lot. And when you do, there are no checkpoints waiting to comfort you.<br><br>Just you, your pogo stick, and a long way up.<br><br>This game is not for the faint of heart - it's for those willing to climb, fall, and climb again.<br><br>Do you have what it takes to reach the top?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3984960/8ccb955ad4cb79d16e90d0649d3f02c966b7073f.jpg"},{"name":"Completed 5 times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3984960/d1b8036e2e9f4fcad55a81a8d16386447deb4f5f.jpg"},{"name":"Stuck with it","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3984960/23fbc5dd3a232389fcb1b503add614fbe6f37486.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome to Hell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3984960/0db8112a0fcbc805c7da3332575bcf42e121e8b9.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984960?t=1759839415","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984960?t=1759839415","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984960/ac201777e6a955fdf6da788a5295b71ba5762c9e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759839415","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984960/ac201777e6a955fdf6da788a5295b71ba5762c9e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759839415","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"